# ── Frontend Environment Variables ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to .env.local for local overrides (never commit .env.local)
#
# In DEVELOPMENT: leave VITE_API_URL unset — Vite's proxy (vite.config.ts)
#   forwards /api/... → http://localhost:8000 automatically.
#
# In PRODUCTION (Vercel): set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel dashboard:
#   Vercel → Your Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Key:   VITE_API_URL
#   Value: https://recruitai-backend.onrender.com   (your Render URL, no trailing slash)
#
# !! IMPORTANT: After adding/changing this variable you MUST redeploy Vercel.
#    Vite bakes env vars into the bundle at build time — runtime changes don't apply.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://recruitai-backend.onrender.com
